      "type": "solution",
      "questionNumber": 19,
      "stem": "设 f (x ) 在 [0, 1] 上连续且递减，证明：当 $0 < \\lambda < 1$ $\\int _ { 0 } ^ { \\lambda } f ( x ) \\mathrm { d } x \\geqslant \\lambda \\int _ { 0 } ^ { 1 } f ( x ) \\mathrm { d } x$",
      "options": [],
      "answer": null,
      "answerStatus": "missing",
      "explanation": "解. 由积分中值定理以及函数的单调性可得\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} \\int_ {0} ^ {\\lambda} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x - \\lambda \\int_ {0} ^ {1} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x = (1 - \\lambda) \\int_ {0} ^ {\\lambda} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x - \\lambda \\int_ {\\lambda} ^ {1} f (x) \\mathrm{d} x \\\\ = (1 - \\lambda) \\cdot \\lambda f (\\xi_ {1}) - \\lambda \\cdot (1 - \\lambda) f (\\xi_ {2}) \\\\ = \\lambda (1 - \\lambda) [ f (\\xi_ {1}) - f (\\xi_ {2}) ] \\geqslant 0. \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$",
